# ==============================================================================
# Applied Electric Field Snippet (fix efield)
# Apply when: Electrolyte / slab MD under a uniform external field
# ==============================================================================
# PREREQUISITES:
# - Acts ONLY on charged atoms (force = q x E): pair style must carry charges
#   (e.g. lj/cut/coul/long with atom_style full). Most MLFF models do NOT expose
#   per-atom q — check your model before applying a field to it.
# - With units metal the field is in V/A; 0.1 V/A is already strong.

# >>> USER: replace "electrolyte" with your own group name <<<
fix             fld electrolyte efield 0.0 0.0 0.1    # ex ey ez (V/A, units metal)

# Gentler onset: ramp the field instead of switching it on
# variable        ez equal ramp(0.0, 0.1)
# fix             fld electrolyte efield 0.0 0.0 v_ez
